= February 2026 — A resolution becomes a diplomatic address

<span class=""><b>Tom Rose</b></span>, the United States ambassador to Poland under President **Donald
Trump**, announces that he will have no further dealings with **Marta Stożek**,
the Razem politician now serving as Marshal of the Sejm.

Stożek has put a resolution before the Council of Seniors for a place on the
Sejm agenda. It demands a government report on Polish links to organisations
supporting illegal settlement in the occupied Palestinian territories,
condemns violence against civilians in Gaza and calls for unimpeded
humanitarian access. As an MP she asked those questions in an interpellation.
As Marshal she can put them before the chamber. Rose calls the text a one-sided
attack on Israel and the Trump administration, and says direct contact can
resume when it leaves the timetable.

The empty chair is personal and institutional at once. Rose can deny the
Marshal a meeting; he cannot close Congress, NATO staffs, the Polish Foreign
Ministry, the Palace or the Sejm's foreign-affairs committee. Stożek can defend
the chamber's timetable; she cannot make the resolution Polish foreign policy
without a vote and government action.

Lewica must decide whether to defend its Marshal and the text, clarify that
humanitarian law is not an alliance rupture, force contact into formal Sejm
rules or remove the item to restore White House access. Razem's internationalist
wing fears capitulation. The party's Atlanticists fear turning one resolution
into a test of the security relationship.

[? if gaza_chain_stage >= 3 and gaza_stance_score >= 2: Stożek's resolution is
not a departure. It is the parliamentary form of the line this party has held
since October 2023, through Damian Soból's convoy and the removal of the
Warsaw encampment. Whatever we decide today will be read against that record
rather than against this month.?]
[? if gaza_chain_stage >= 3 and gaza_stance_score <= -1: The awkwardness is
internal before it is diplomatic. Our own statements on Gaza have run the
other way — no ceasefire demand, an inquiry accepted from the army that
conducted the strike, the rector backed against the students. The Marshal's
resolution is Razem's continuity and the leadership's reversal.?]

- @ambassador_stand
- @ambassador_clarify
- @ambassador_committee
- @ambassador_rules
- @ambassador_apologise

@ambassador_stand
title: Stand by the disputed text and demand respect for the Sejm
subtitle: Defend the Marshal's independence and move American contact away from an ambassador who refuses it.
on-arrival: {!
Q.us_ambassador_channel -= 5;
Q.us_congress_channel += 3;
Q.party_unity += 3;
if (Q.sejm_speaker == "Marta Stożek") {
    Q.razem_dissent -= 2;
    Q.barons_dissent += 2;
} else {
    Q.barons_dissent -= 2;
}
Q.left_atlanticist_dissent += 7;
Q.ko_relation -= 3;
Q.public_trust += 1;
// The 2023–2024 Gaza record decides whether this reads as a line or a
// conversion. Consistency is worth more than the defiance itself.
const gazaRecord26 = Number(Q.gaza_chain_stage) >= 3
    ? Number(Q.gaza_stance_score) || 0 : null;
if (gazaRecord26 !== null && gazaRecord26 >= 2) {
    Q.razem_dissent -= 4;
    Q.progressive_credibility += 3;
    Q.foreign_policy_responsibility += 2;
} else if (gazaRecord26 !== null && gazaRecord26 <= -1) {
    Q.party_unity -= 5;
    Q.progressive_credibility -= 3;
    Q.media_capacity -= 2;
    Q.public_trust -= 2;
}
Q.news_headline =
    "The Marshal turns the boycott into a sovereignty dispute";
!}

[? if sejm_speaker = "Marta Stożek": Stożek puts the resolution before the
Council of Seniors unchanged and invites every parliamentary club to defend the
Sejm's right to debate it even if the club votes no.?][? if sejm_speaker !=
"Marta Stożek": Czarzasty reads the disputed sentence again from the Marshal's
rostrum and invites every parliamentary club to defend the office even if it
rejects his words.?] Rose stays away. Lewica's MPs open compensating
conversations with Congress, while KO refuses to join a defence it thinks
confuses one political text with the dignity of the whole chamber.

[? if gaza_chain_stage >= 3 and gaza_stance_score >= 2: Nobody has to be
persuaded that we mean it. The ceasefire demand, the Soból inquiry and the
campus disclosure campaign are all on the same shelf, and a party that has
been saying this since 2023 pays a smaller price for saying it again.?]
[? if gaza_chain_stage >= 3 and gaza_stance_score <= -1: The problem is that
the archive is public. Every broadcaster runs our October 2023 statement beside
