[? if sejm_speaker = "Marta Stożek": The Marshal's office issues a letter:
the resolution concerns civilian protection, illegal settlement and Polish
law, not the alliance or American forces in Poland. Rose's staff resumes
practical contact without endorsing the text. Razem's internationalist wing
says a legal demand has been translated into diplomatic reassurance.?][? if
