@ambassador_committee
title: Send the whole file to the foreign-affairs committee under the 2023–2024 record
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Available only on a consistent Gaza record; keeps the substance, converts a personal boycott into a standing inquiry and accepts a longer freeze.
view-if: gaza_chain_stage >= 3 and gaza_stance_score >= 2
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: A standing committee inquiry needs one resource for counsel and clerks.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
Q.gaza_committee_inquiry = 1;
Q.us_congress_channel += 9;
Q.us_ambassador_channel -= 3;
Q.foreign_policy_responsibility += 4;
Q.parliament_visibility = (Number(Q.parliament_visibility) || 40) + 4;
Q.constitutional_restraint += 2;
Q.media_capacity += 2;
Q.razem_dissent -= 5;
Q.left_atlanticist_dissent += 4;
Q.progressive_credibility += 3;
Q.public_trust += 1;
Q.ambassador_outcome =
    "The disputed text becomes a standing committee inquiry with a documented record";
Q.news_headline =
    "The Gaza file moves from the Marshal's desk to a standing Sejm inquiry";
!}

Nothing is withdrawn and nothing is escalated. The resolution, the 2025
interpellation, the convoy file and the university correspondence go to the
foreign-affairs committee as one numbered inquiry with counsel, a reporting
date and a duty on ministries to answer in writing.

This is only available because the material exists. A party that improvised a
position this month would have nothing to put in the folder; three years of
consistent demands produce a case file that Congressional staff can read and
that Rose cannot answer by cancelling a lunch. The cost is that the boycott now
has an official reason to continue, and our Atlanticists have to defend a
standing inquiry into an ally rather than a single bad week.

- @poland_event_queue: Open the committee inquiry

@ambassador_rules
title: Invite the ambassador to a formal institutional meeting
subtitle: Spend parliamentary capacity on a meeting whose agenda and minutes belong to the Sejm, not either office-holder's pride.
