The invitation comes from the Sejm Presidium and places party leaders, the
foreign-affairs committee and a published agenda beside **[+ sejm_speaker +]**. Rose attends
an institutional meeting he can describe as larger than the Marshal. Contact
resumes, and neither side receives the personal capitulation it had demanded.

[? if gaza_chain_stage >= 3 and gaza_stance_score = 0: The procedural route
works unusually well here, for an unflattering reason. Three years of refusing
to settle a line on Gaza left us with no substantive position anyone needs to
be reconciled to, which is exactly the qualification for chairing a meeting
about who may talk to whom. Our own members notice what the compliment
means.?]

- @poland_event_queue: Issue the Presidium invitation

